<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= locale %>">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= locale === 'he' ? 'אודות המוזיאון' : 'About the Museum' %> - JWM WWII</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styles.css">
  <style>
    /* --- Header & Nav --- */
    .header-flex { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 15px 0; }
    header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin: 0; color: #fff; border-inline-start: 4px solid #0038b8; padding-inline-start: 15px; }
    .nav-bar { background: #f8f9fa; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px 0; }
    .nav-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }

    /* --- Page Content --- */
    .about-header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      background: white;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .about-header h1 { color: #0038b8; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .about-header p { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #444; }

    /* --- Photo Story Grid --- */
    .story-section {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 60px;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .story-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 40px;
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }

    .story-row:nth-child(even) { flex-direction: row-reverse; }

    .story-img {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 500px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .story-text {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .story-text h2 { color: #0038b8; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .story-text p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #555; }

    /* Mobile Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .story-row, .story-row:nth-child(even) { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
      .story-img { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; }
      .nav-container { flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="lang-<%= locale %>">

<header>
  <div class="container header-flex">
    <h1><%= locale === 'he' ? 'מוזיאון הלוחם היהודי במלחמת העולם השנייה' : 'Museum of the Jewish Soldier in World War II' %></h1>
    <div class="logo-area"><img src="/images/Outlook-dieerunr.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 80px;"></div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="nav-bar">
  <div class="container nav-container">
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/"><%= __('nav.home') %></a>
      <a href="/aboutMuseum" style="font-weight:bold; color:#0038b8;"><%= locale === 'he' ? 'אודות' : 'About' %></a>
      <a href="/donations"><%= locale === 'he' ? 'תרומות' : 'Donations' %></a>
      <a href="/admin-login">Admin Access</a>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-switcher">
      <form action="/change-lang" method="get" style="margin:0;">
        <select name="lang" onchange="this.form.submit()" style="border: 2px solid #0038b8; border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 15px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;">
            <option value="he" <%= locale === 'he' ? 'selected' : '' %>>עברית</option>
            <option value="en" <%= locale === 'en' ? 'selected' : '' %>>English</option>
            <option value="ru" <%= locale === 'ru' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Русский</option>
        </select>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<main class="container">
  <section class="about-header">
    <h1><%= locale === 'he' ? 'מורשת וגבורה' : 'Legacy and Heroism' %></h1>
    <p>
      <%= locale === 'he' 
          ? 'המוזיאון מנציח את גבורתם של 1.5 מיליון הלוחמים היהודים ששירתו בצבאות בעלות הברית וביחידות הפרטיזנים במהלך מלחמת העולם השנייה.' 
          : 'The museum commemorates the heroism of 1.5 million Jewish soldiers who served in the Allied forces and partisan units during World War II.' %>
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="story-section">
    
    <div class="story-row">
      <img src="\images\TheMuseum1.jpg" alt="Exhibition" class="story-img">
      <div